# Post-change verification

After any code change in this repository:

1. `npm run check:types` must complete with no errors
2. `npm run lint` must complete with no errors (max warnings: 0)
3. `npm run test` must complete with no errors

If any command fails, fix the issues before considering the work done.

You can run all three: `npm run check:types && npm run lint && npm run test`
